IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDIST-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-NODES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 GPUS-PER-NODE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 INTERCONNECTS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDIST-V3.
    IF NUM-NODES == 0 OR GPUS-PER-NODE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-NODES TO INTERCONNECTS.
    MULTIPLY GPUS-PER-NODE BY INTERCONNECTS.
    MOVE 385 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 INTERCONNECTS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
